### The tests

Test 1 (2006-2019, net): volatility ratio MV-LW/IV 0.633 (needs <= 0.90); Sharpe MV-LW − IV +0.109, one-sided p 0.209 (needs < 0.10) -> FAIL
Test 2 (2020-2025-06, net): volatility ratio 0.764 (needs < 1); Sharpe difference -0.316 (needs > 0) -> FAIL
The number: (Sharpe MV-LW − Sharpe IV, gross, 2006-2025-06) x 15 = (0.436 − 0.466) x 15 = -0.4 (gross difference two-sided p 0.793, one-sided 0.616)
